as !\\nMerci à toute l'équipe et à bientôt ...\\nNous vous recommandons vivement cet établissement .\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-31T15:00:41+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a une semaine\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Amédée Raban\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107458362342757446552/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdLqmiOoLy5WsVV3JqjiMrWt80efxWrWQ1ld07MpXd3jP7fQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Belle découverte\\nTrès bonne cuisine\\nLes serveurs sont très agréables\\nLe lieu est propre\\nJe recommande sans hésitation\\nLes saveurs sont au rdv je reviendrai\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-28T18:46:23+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Nath Bog\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116233411169142315032/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQ69Ls-nZnPwZV46TnSuH4YIgUX0g4Hu07FUtxcQisr2ueLQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"La cuisine est délicieuse, le service très chaleureux et l’ambiance intimiste. Nous reviendrons\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-25T15:39:42+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Anna S\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107906012313018346688/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWtwT5hyUJcYJ1lX8s1tmkxmI7TcgA4rl5IfC2_MpwE3mFqw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"}]}",
